# OPEN HOUSE: the tailor's +1 lasts all scenario, the upstart gains 1 each
# visit, the moon child is trouble every other visit, and the granny,
# bookworm, poet, barista and storyteller count the room.
game openhouse
wait 5
cheat new 1 1
cheat give 23 1
cheat give 26 1
cheat give 32 1
cheat door 0 23
cheat act 1 0
expect vpop0 == 2
cheat door 26 32
expect vpop2 == 1
expect trouble == 1
cheat end
cheat next
cheat leave
cheat door 0 26 32
expect vpop0 == 2
expect vpop1 == 2
expect trouble == 0
cheat new 1 1
cheat give 21 1
cheat cap 6
cheat door 0 0 21
expect vpop2 == 3
cheat new 1 1
cheat give 22 1
cheat cap 6
cheat door 22
expect vpop0 == 6
cheat new 1 1
cheat give 25 1
cheat give 24 1
cheat door 2 2 25 24
expect vpop2 == 5
expect vcash3 == 4
cheat new 1 1
cheat give 17 1
cheat door 0 0 0 0 17
expect vpop4 == 5
expect vcash4 == -1
